   568	
   569	**G-D3-1** — L1 detects: index behind arrival; out-of-band insert; edit to
   570	the last consumed row; **rewound marker** (mark ordinal < max indexed
   571	ordinal) — each with the expected coordinate in the message.
   572	**G-D3-2** — bounded work, deterministically instrumented (DP-r2-04: no
   573	timing oracle): the harness counts record verifications (a test-scoped
   574	counter on the substrate's record-verification seam) and asserts exact
